    { "id": "NFR5.1", "status": "N/A", "target": "An operating-cost ceiling on the project, not behaviour any user can observe or any story can assert. Enforced at infrastructure-design and environment-provisioning. AC3.1.7 incidentally protects it by asserting the import issues no request to the application's own server." },
